  "meaning": "Compose the existing necessary actual first-root theorem, supplied-root modal/per-se convergence and quarta-via maximum existence. Identify the separately obtained maximum with that SAME actual necessary first root, transporting maximality rather than postulating it. Genus at esse gives universal causal scope; actuality-to-being and restricted universal-source transfer give causal responsibility for every other actual perfection; firstness and the existing no-component premise give remoteness. The retained full-description nominal bridge then names this same root as God. No separate maximum-uniqueness, cause-of-quality ascent, global maximum-to-firstness or pure-act premise is used. The nominal application remains an open naming commitment, not an independent justification of that bridge. This connects existing structured results to GodExists; no philosophical premise is discharged.",
